    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d3">

                <pb facs="0034" n="4" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54Guat/pg4"/>

                <head>3. Telegram From the Central Intelligence Agency to the CIA Station in [<hi
                        rendition="#italic">place not declassified</hi>]<anchor n="1" xml:id="d3-f1"
                    /></head>
                <dateline><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                        when="1952-01-22T23:22:00+00:00">January 22, 1952, 2322Z</date>.</dateline>
                <p>23889. Re: TLB-1589.</p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>It is requested that JULEP locate but not contact Carlos Castillo Armas if
                        in Salvador or Honduras. If located, headquarters should be continually
                        advised of major movements. Reference gives reported permanent [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">less than 1 line of source text not
                            declassified</hi>] address in Honduras.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>Authorization given for JULEP travel Honduras during investigation.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
